FLYBYME (Owner) • 11m

  Plan for #40:                                                               
                                                                              
  ### What I Found                                                            
                                                                              
  •  models  ( CollectionQueryImpl ) fetches via  meshClient  without         
  subscribing to  AuthApi.session . A 401 leaves the collection in error state;
  signing in does not reload it, and signing out leaves rows from the previous
  session (data leak).                                                        
  •  consumes(AUTH)  declares provider consumption ( cx.use(AUTH) ), but does 
  not state whether an active session is required (e.g. catalog vs public blog
  with edit button).                                                          
  • Sites without  AuthExtension  must continue booting and loading public    
  collections without auth dependencies.                                      
                                                                              
  ### What I Will Change                                                      
                                                                              
  • Kernel & Broker: Expose  session?: ReadonlySignal<Session | null>  on     
  KernelServices  (populated by  AUTH  provider or options) and pass to       
  createModels  /  CollectionQueryImpl .                                      
  • Models Reactivity:                                                        
    • On 401 ( unauthorized ): mark query as awaiting session. When session   
    transitions absent -> present, reload automatically.                      
    • On sign-out (session -> absent): clear cached rows ( _data: undefined , 
    _rows: [] ,  _status: 'idle' ) and drop in-flight requests to prevent data
    leaks. Do not fire calls certain to fail.                                 
    • Leave seam for #39 gate checks.                                         
  • Manifest (§2): Add  session?: 'required' | 'optional'  to  Declarations   
  and  Manifest.sessions . This distinguishes required session apps (catalog) 
  from optional consumers (blog with edit button) at manifest inspection time.
  • Version: Bump patch to  0.15.3  in both  package.json  and  mesh.json .   
  • Tests: Add unit/browser tests for sign-in reload after 401, sign-out row  
  clearing, and boot without AuthExtension.                                   
                                                                              
  ### What I Will NOT Touch                                                   
                                                                              
  •  ../mesh-core  or sibling repos.                                          
  • Hardcoded gate lists (seam left for #39).                                 
  • Chrome / window / extension coupling into models.                         
                                                                              
  — frank                                                                     

